WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
Being in the program wasn't just like taking a class from somebody. It was getting

2
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:10.560
a partner in this. Every time I've ever gone to you, the response was right away. The idea

3
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.440
of having live claims clinic where it's all right there, and we can chat back and forth.

4
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.560
I don't see anybody else out there with that capability or even the offering.

5
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:26.160
So thank you. Like a month after I signed up and began the course with you is when the

6
