18
00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:45.520
and things you just have to be aware of how to do. There's a lot to this. And it's so important.

19
00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:50.240
If you're on the receiving end of someone in crisis, and you get somebody who just

20
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.360
thinks they know what they're doing, and they show up with their clipboards and their cameras, and

21
